WEBVTT

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:04.068
And this is why former delinquents
are so much trouble!

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:06.299
Damn it!
So you've shown yourselves, huh?

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:10.435
This is no place for you Spec Sec guys!
Stay away!

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:15.676
The best to way to kill those things
is with a sword... A hunter's sword!

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.651
You understand now, right?

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:29.560
This isn't a case
you ordinary people can handle.

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.530
Shut up! Muramasa!

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:33.657
Quick, go to the Self Defense Forces
and bring back a tank!

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.531
C-Chief, any more than this and...

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:36.830
An attack chopper, too!

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.337
But that's...

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:35.948
Bonds

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:39.254
Why you, stop messing with us!
Don't think you'll get away with this!

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:42.261
C-Chief Kunikida!
Please calm down!

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:44.263
What, Muramasa! Are you going to let
them talk you down like that!?

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:46.265
Please calm down for now!

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:49.700
Hey, let go! Let me go, I say!
Damn it, you idiots!

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:02.714
You're the girl that was always drawing
at the apartment back then, aren't you?

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:08.778
So you're a survivor, too, right?

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:09.913
But why?

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:11.253
Do you mean them?

00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:14.021
Y-Yeah... that, and...

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:18.019
They'll be showing up from here on, too.
Until you take out the main body.

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:21.033
Main body?
What do you mean, main body?

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.535
The main body that controls them.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:26.471
What!?
You don't mean that the things...

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:27.632
...that attacked us at the apartment
were also...

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:31.300
You'll eventually understand.

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:40.249
I'm looking forward to it.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.255
Sakura Rokujo...

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:54.296
That's right, she had just moved in
from far away...

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:58.100
...and was always being picked on
by the bad kids in the neighborhood.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:00.264
She was a weird little girl who,
no matter what happened to her...

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:01.967
...just kept quiet
as she drew her pictures.

00:04:02.008 --> 00:04:06.308
You couldn't tell what she was thinking.

00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:11.249
But she was a girl that you
just couldn't leave be...

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:13.844
She had eyes that felt like you
were embracing a darkness...

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:15.820
...greater than anyone else...

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:24.655
I can't believe
that I got rescued by her.

00:04:31.738 --> 00:04:34.070
What in the world is this...

00:04:39.045 --> 00:04:40.034
Big brother!

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:42.775
Whoa! Saya!
What do you want, all of a sudden?

00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:44.214
At least say something first!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:48.209
But we're siblings, right?
More importantly, we've decided.

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:49.050
Decided what?

00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:50.885
The mixer, the mixer.

00:04:50.923 --> 00:04:54.222
I talked to most of the girls
from our jurisdiction.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:54.783
Huh?

00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:57.489
When I did, they were all
really interested.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:00.158
The guys from the special mobilized
force are all popular, you know?

00:05:00.199 --> 00:05:02.531
They were really jealous of me.

00:05:02.568 --> 00:05:04.934
They said that what you need in life
is a big brother!

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:08.702
H-Hold on a second,
I still haven't said that I was going.

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:11.938
So, it's going to be this Saturday,
at 7:30 PM.

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:13.036
Don't forget.

00:05:13.079 --> 00:05:14.410
Hey, now...

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:17.245
Oh, yeah, would you like for me
to scrub your back?

00:05:17.283 --> 00:05:19.615
And maybe I should get in the bath, too.

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:22.212
We used to take baths together
a lot back then, didn't we?

00:05:22.255 --> 00:05:24.553
D-Dummy! I'm getting out now!

00:05:26.893 --> 00:05:28.053
Big brother?

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:29.083
Huh?

00:05:29.128 --> 00:05:30.595
What's that?

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:36.660
Oh... t-this is, you know, a bruise I got
during the last investigation.

00:05:36.703 --> 00:05:38.364
It looks like a tattoo.

00:05:38.404 --> 00:05:42.704
D-Don't worry.
This'll be gone soon enough.

00:05:42.742 --> 00:05:43.936
Did you go see the doctor?

00:05:43.976 --> 00:05:46.877
Dummy, there's no way I'd go
to the doctor over a bruise like this.

00:05:46.913 --> 00:05:48.346
That's not right!

00:05:48.381 --> 00:05:50.315
You're going
to the doctor first thing tomorrow!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.784
Got it?
I'm going with you, too.

00:05:52.819 --> 00:05:55.253
What's with that?
I'm not a kid.

00:05:55.288 --> 00:05:57.017
It's all right, you don't have
to come with me.

00:05:57.056 --> 00:06:01.720
No, no, you're so negligent,
if I leave you be, you're sure to not go.

00:06:01.761 --> 00:06:04.286
What would you do
if it was something horrible?

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:06.093
You're making too big a deal out of this.

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:09.295
In any case, tonight you need to take
care of yourself and go to bed early!

00:06:09.335 --> 00:06:11.963
Sleep? It's only 8:30!

00:06:12.004 --> 00:06:14.734
Never mind that, hurry up
and change into your pajamas!

00:06:14.774 --> 00:06:17.868
Don't be stupid!
There's a show I want to watch tonight!

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.741
Whoa!
Hey, what are you doing?

00:06:19.779 --> 00:06:21.508
Do what you're told!

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:40.065
Udagawa Police Hospital

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:43.330
The pigmentation might be
accumulating there.

00:06:43.369 --> 00:06:45.269
So, does it hurt?

00:06:45.304 --> 00:06:46.328
Not really...

00:06:46.372 --> 00:06:49.603
Doctor, what do you mean,
pigmentation?

00:06:49.642 --> 00:06:51.872
This.

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.970
A stain?

00:06:54.013 --> 00:06:57.710
Right.
That's why I'm telling you to not worry.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:01.811
On that note, has there been any kind
of intense stimulation done to your skin?

00:07:01.854 --> 00:07:03.879
Stimulation...

00:07:03.923 --> 00:07:06.255
For example,
exposure to strong UV rays...

00:07:06.292 --> 00:07:09.853
...or being covered in some kind
of special chemical.

00:07:09.896 --> 00:07:11.557
No, not really.

00:07:11.597 --> 00:07:14.259
Even still, this is quite
an impressive pattern.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:16.564
It looks like it was tattooed on.

00:07:16.602 --> 00:07:18.331
D-Doctor...

00:07:18.371 --> 00:07:20.999
No, there's probably no need to worry.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.407
Well, I think that it's a kind of
congestive inflammation of the skin...

00:07:24.444 --> 00:07:25.877
...so it'll get better soon.

00:07:25.912 --> 00:07:30.542
Really? And, will it leave a scar,
or get bigger?

00:07:30.583 --> 00:07:31.845
H-Hey now, Saya.

00:07:31.884 --> 00:07:36.253
Ha ha ha ha!
It's like you're his mother or something.

00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:38.416
N-No, that's...

00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:41.757
We'll have his blood tested, too,
just to be certain.

00:07:41.794 --> 00:07:44.763
See? Nothing to worry about.

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:47.288
But we still haven't gotten the results
from the blood test, and...

00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:48.823
It'll be fine.

00:07:48.868 --> 00:07:52.099
In any case, I'm going to get some
medicine from the pharmacy.

00:07:52.138 --> 00:07:54.698
So you stay here.
Got it?

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.731
Don't you go heading off on your own.

00:07:59.312 --> 00:08:01.803
Jeez...

00:08:01.848 --> 00:08:04.476
Oh, I'd better call Kunikida...

00:08:04.517 --> 00:08:06.280
Huh!?

00:08:06.319 --> 00:08:09.254
Dang, I forgot my cell phone!

00:08:16.829 --> 00:08:20.765
Now, where are the public phones...

00:08:23.803 --> 00:08:26.271
What in the world... does this mean?

00:08:28.841 --> 00:08:33.369
Miss Shindo, please fill out
the required areas.

00:08:33.412 --> 00:08:34.811
Okay.

00:08:34.847 --> 00:08:40.080
Also, the doctor wants to talk to you
afterwards, so please wait here for a bit.

00:08:40.119 --> 00:08:42.087
O-Okay.

00:08:42.121 --> 00:08:45.147
Yes... t-that's right.

00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:46.852
Actually, I'm at
the hospital right now...

00:08:46.893 --> 00:08:48.588
When you get back here,
you've got bathroom duty!

00:08:48.628 --> 00:08:52.029
What? Bathroom duty again?
But you see, right now...

00:08:52.064 --> 00:08:53.793
Shut up!
This is an order!

00:08:53.833 --> 00:08:55.460
Y-Yes, sir.
I understand.

00:08:57.537 --> 00:09:02.236
What the hell is with Kunikida?
At least listen all the way through.

00:09:02.275 --> 00:09:04.402
Jeez, but I can't stand him.

00:09:04.443 --> 00:09:05.432
Hmm?

00:09:08.514 --> 00:09:13.213
Huh, a brick building...
that's unusual in this day and age.

00:09:13.252 --> 00:09:16.551
Oh, big brother, I told you
not to go anywhere, too!

00:09:20.126 --> 00:09:22.117
I guess it's the old building...

00:09:30.903 --> 00:09:33.133
Who are they?

00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:38.274
Is there something in there?

00:09:42.515 --> 00:09:43.607
W-What was that just now?

00:09:49.689 --> 00:09:52.658
It can't be...

00:09:52.692 --> 00:09:55.490
I've never seen anything
like this up until now.

00:09:55.528 --> 00:09:58.793
It's true that you can't
consider this normal.

00:09:58.831 --> 00:10:02.631
I've sent a sample of this
for DNA analysis.

00:10:02.668 --> 00:10:04.932
There should be an accurate reading
any time now.

00:10:04.971 --> 00:10:07.701
So, where is that young man right now?

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:11.039
I have him waiting in the waiting room
with his sister.

00:10:16.616 --> 00:10:19.642
The more you hide something,
the more you want to see it.

00:10:19.685 --> 00:10:22.176
That's only human.

00:10:24.023 --> 00:10:27.959
In any case, even if I go to work,
I'll be cleaning the bathrooms.

00:10:32.531 --> 00:10:35.830
It's amazingly modern inside.

00:10:58.491 --> 00:11:01.426
Who is that?

00:11:06.499 --> 00:11:10.663
W-What in the world i-is happening
all of a sudden?

00:11:17.376 --> 00:11:19.674
Damn it... again?

00:11:39.999 --> 00:11:44.368
Late Night Gun Battle
A late night gun battle
between illegal drug cartels.

00:11:44.403 --> 00:11:48.897
Scenes of casualties from both
the police and the cartels.

00:11:48.941 --> 00:11:51.671
The police and the press
in a struggle over the story.

00:11:51.711 --> 00:11:54.703
The police cover-up of the evidence.

00:11:54.747 --> 00:11:58.148
Huh, the stuff about the monsters
is completely and utterly gone.

00:11:58.184 --> 00:12:00.379
Yeah, the same as always, right?

00:12:00.419 --> 00:12:05.220
Jeez! Where did all of the corpses
we worked so hard to collect go?

00:12:05.257 --> 00:12:07.953
But I wonder what he's planning
on doing now...

00:12:07.993 --> 00:12:09.290
Who?

00:12:09.328 --> 00:12:12.764
Kunikida. I wonder if he's learned
his lesson, and if he'll back off...

00:12:12.798 --> 00:12:13.787
No way.

00:12:13.833 --> 00:12:19.135
Yeah, he really seems persistent, but
I guess you might say he's obsessed...

00:12:19.171 --> 00:12:21.799
Who's obsessed?

00:12:21.841 --> 00:12:25.140
- Whoa! Chief!
- Whoa! Chief!

00:12:25.177 --> 00:12:27.008
We've got work!

00:12:27.046 --> 00:12:28.274
- Y-Yes, sir!
- Y-Yes, sir!

00:12:28.314 --> 00:12:32.808
Listen up, there's no need to wait
for the order to fire this time.

00:12:32.852 --> 00:12:35.548
It doesn't matter,
just shoot them as they appear!

00:12:35.588 --> 00:12:37.647
U-Umm, but...

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:41.592
Yeah, I know, you want to say
that guns don't work on them.

00:12:41.627 --> 00:12:46.030
All you have to do is buy some time
until the Spec Sec guys show up!

00:12:46.065 --> 00:12:46.554
Huh?

00:12:46.599 --> 00:12:49.659
It doesn't matter what,
but gather evidence.

00:12:49.702 --> 00:12:51.260
A scrap of flesh,
some blood, anything.

00:12:52.571 --> 00:12:56.029
We're going to bring the true identity
of the monsters to light!

00:12:56.075 --> 00:12:57.736
If you've got it, then get going!

00:12:57.777 --> 00:13:00.769
This time, we're going to show them
for what they really are!

00:13:01.347 --> 00:13:03.076
Yes, sir!

00:13:05.417 --> 00:13:07.180
Hey! What are you doing!?

00:13:07.219 --> 00:13:08.652
R-Right!

00:13:08.687 --> 00:13:12.919
Jeez, what in the world is he doing
at an urgent time like this, and where?

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:21.989
This is...

00:13:23.569 --> 00:13:24.593
Are you awake now?

00:13:26.739 --> 00:13:30.197
R-Rokujo?

00:13:30.242 --> 00:13:32.403
You were passed out in the hallway.

00:13:32.444 --> 00:13:33.502
In the hallway?

00:13:33.546 --> 00:13:34.877
Yeah...

00:13:34.914 --> 00:13:39.351
But why are you here?
And... where is here?

00:13:39.385 --> 00:13:41.512
It's a closed-off ward.

00:13:41.554 --> 00:13:44.955
There's no unauthorized entry
normally, but...

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.787
A closed-off ward?

00:13:46.826 --> 00:13:47.815
You saw, right?

00:13:52.398 --> 00:13:53.660
He's my younger brother.

00:13:53.699 --> 00:13:55.189
Younger brother!?

00:13:55.234 --> 00:13:58.465
He's been asleep
for over five years, though...

00:13:58.504 --> 00:13:59.869
Five years?

00:13:59.905 --> 00:14:02.100
Do you mean he had
an accident or something?

00:14:03.442 --> 00:14:06.570
It can't be at Machida?

00:14:06.612 --> 00:14:12.414
That day... when I got back from school,
I heard his voice...

00:14:12.451 --> 00:14:14.783
...calling out for me to save him.

00:14:23.495 --> 00:14:28.296
When I came into the room, it was
after his body had been cut to shreds.

00:14:28.334 --> 00:14:31.428
Since then, he hasn't been able
to wake up.

00:14:33.172 --> 00:14:39.133
And right now, he can't breathe
without a machine.

00:14:39.178 --> 00:14:43.842
But I didn't know that you had
a younger brother.

00:14:43.883 --> 00:14:49.651
He had always been sick,
and so stayed at home, so...

00:14:49.688 --> 00:14:53.590
Rokujo, it was them, right?

00:14:53.626 --> 00:14:57.892
It was them that attacked us in
Machida... that attacked my parents?

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:01.866
Tell me!
What in the world are they?

00:15:01.901 --> 00:15:04.131
What do they want?

00:15:04.169 --> 00:15:08.367
And who in the world
are you Spec Sec guys?

00:15:08.407 --> 00:15:09.396
Rokujo!

00:15:11.977 --> 00:15:13.911
So you can't tell me, no matter what?

00:15:15.481 --> 00:15:20.942
We exist to kill them.
That's all I can say right now.

00:15:20.986 --> 00:15:25.446
Because that's our rule...

00:15:25.491 --> 00:15:29.951
Is this... really where
the slaughter happened?

00:15:29.995 --> 00:15:31.462
There's no mistaking it.

00:15:31.497 --> 00:15:35.729
Damn it! What the hell!

00:15:37.403 --> 00:15:40.736
It looks like you were
a little late, delinquent.

00:15:40.773 --> 00:15:42.502
I see, I understand.

00:15:43.475 --> 00:15:44.567
Kureha.

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:45.838
There's been a response,
hasn't there?

00:15:47.046 --> 00:15:48.104
It's number 12.

00:15:48.147 --> 00:15:51.241
Jeez, I wonder how many it's going
to spawn until it's satisfied.

00:15:51.283 --> 00:15:54.218
By the way, where's Sakura?

00:15:54.253 --> 00:15:58.019
She said she had to go see someone
at the hospital, as always.

00:15:58.057 --> 00:16:01.254
I see. So he still hasn't regained
consciousness?

00:16:01.293 --> 00:16:06.253
Admittedly, that might end up
being for the best.

00:16:06.298 --> 00:16:09.893
Dr. Kawaguchi of internal medicine,
please call room 387.

00:16:09.935 --> 00:16:13.837
Oh, big brother, where did you go?

00:16:35.728 --> 00:16:38.219
W-What is that?

00:16:40.799 --> 00:16:44.735
Stop it... stay away... go away!

00:16:54.413 --> 00:16:55.539
The scent...

00:16:56.615 --> 00:16:57.980
Something smells of it...

00:17:08.594 --> 00:17:10.152
That voice just now!

00:17:10.195 --> 00:17:12.129
Laboratory

00:17:18.904 --> 00:17:20.132
What is it?

00:17:33.018 --> 00:17:36.454
What in the world?
What's going on?

00:17:40.125 --> 00:17:42.992
So they really are guys
from the Security division.

00:17:43.028 --> 00:17:46.088
This ward, and only this ward,
belongs to a different jurisdiction.

00:17:46.131 --> 00:17:49.760
And thus,
that's why your brother is here.

00:17:49.802 --> 00:17:51.827
Spec Sec is directly
under the jurisdiction

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:53.963
of the Security division after all.

00:17:54.006 --> 00:17:57.066
Hey, what's it like being in Spec Sec?

00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:04.807
P-Put both of your hands behind
your head and get on the ground!

00:18:07.853 --> 00:18:11.289
Do you hear me?
T-This time I'll really shoot!

00:18:22.234 --> 00:18:24.702
You smell... you smell...

00:18:24.736 --> 00:18:25.964
What?

00:18:26.004 --> 00:18:27.596
You smell like a survivor.

00:18:27.639 --> 00:18:29.004
Stop!

00:18:44.389 --> 00:18:45.651
Saya!

00:18:46.291 --> 00:18:47.815
Big brother!

00:18:56.268 --> 00:18:58.031
Saya, give me your gun!

00:19:07.613 --> 00:19:08.875
Big brother!

00:19:08.914 --> 00:19:10.381
D-Damn it!

00:19:39.511 --> 00:19:40.637
Inukai?

00:19:42.047 --> 00:19:43.241
Saya.

00:19:43.282 --> 00:19:46.740
I'm all right.
I just remembered it a little bit...

00:20:03.101 --> 00:20:04.728
The smell of our blood?

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:10.640
Yeah, they tracked the smell of
your blood, yours and your sister's...

00:20:10.676 --> 00:20:14.737
...because you have the same smell
as the other survivors of that incident.

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:17.840
Then it's not just me
that's being targeted.

00:20:17.883 --> 00:20:20.078
Your younger sister is as well.

00:20:20.118 --> 00:20:24.077
Damn it! Why?

00:20:24.122 --> 00:20:30.584
They're phantoms that live
in a different world from ours.

00:20:30.629 --> 00:20:32.597
Phantoms.

00:20:32.631 --> 00:20:36.965
Modern science and methods
don't work on them at all.

00:20:37.002 --> 00:20:40.768
They're the same
as ghosts and goblins.

00:20:40.806 --> 00:20:43.673
They come from the underworld
to eat people.

00:20:43.709 --> 00:20:47.076
Rokujo, why do you...

00:20:48.247 --> 00:20:51.842
What I know is the same as you.

00:20:56.521 --> 00:20:58.489
Homemade Oden-Noriko
It was pretty tough, you know...

00:20:58.523 --> 00:21:02.482
Really?
But it was quite an experience, right?

00:21:02.527 --> 00:21:04.495
Hey, which one do you like?
Take a look!

00:21:04.529 --> 00:21:08.989
Hey, so how did you explain this last
incident to your sister?

00:21:09.034 --> 00:21:12.697
I told you, I said that a patient hopped up
on drugs went on a rampage...

00:21:12.738 --> 00:21:14.638
And she believed that?

00:21:14.673 --> 00:21:16.004
It's all right.

00:21:16.041 --> 00:21:19.772
And so I'd like for us to raise a glass
and make a toast!

00:21:19.811 --> 00:21:22.541
This is also doubling as a gathering
to get acquainted,

00:21:22.581 --> 00:21:24.674
so we've called in a special guest!

00:21:24.716 --> 00:21:26.411
Special guest?

00:21:26.451 --> 00:21:27.679
News to me.

00:21:27.719 --> 00:21:30.051
Yo! I'm Kunikida!

00:21:30.856 --> 00:21:33.017
Mr. Kunikida, welcome, welcome!

00:21:33.058 --> 00:21:35.151
- Thanks for the hard work!
- Thanks for the hard work!

00:21:37.362 --> 00:21:39.296
What's that? You want to join
the Special Mobile division?

00:21:39.331 --> 00:21:40.491
I do!

00:21:40.532 --> 00:21:41.521
If I use my connections,
it'll be a breeze.

00:21:41.566 --> 00:21:44.228
Hey, Saya, what's up with this?

00:21:44.269 --> 00:21:45.896
Well, it felt like it would
have been dangerous

00:21:45.937 --> 00:21:47.802
if it was just you and your friends.

00:21:47.839 --> 00:21:51.570
Dummy, it's a lot more dangerous
to invite him!

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:53.100
There's no meaning to this now!

00:21:53.145 --> 00:21:55.943
What's up with that, and after I went
through all the trouble to set this up!

00:21:55.981 --> 00:21:58.814
Whenever you do anything,
it ends up being like this, you know?

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:01.717
Hey! I did this because I was worried!

00:22:01.753 --> 00:22:03.948
Would you quit treating me
like a kid already?

00:22:03.989 --> 00:22:07.254
H-Hey, Shindo, I think
you should stop while...

00:22:07.292 --> 00:22:10.261
Shut up!
Today I'm going to speak my mind!

00:22:10.295 --> 00:22:12.923
Fine! I'll listen to whatever
you have to say!

00:22:12.964 --> 00:22:15.865
Oh, now you've gone and said it!
Okay, then shut up and listen!

00:22:15.901 --> 00:22:17.892
You, too!

00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:46.427
I held that hand

00:22:46.465 --> 00:22:51.402
And we kissed

00:22:51.436 --> 00:22:56.203
After a little while

00:22:56.241 --> 00:23:01.110
It will quietly become
our final day

00:23:01.146 --> 00:23:07.574
Please, no matter what,
never forget

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:11.220
Sherry, far away

00:23:11.256 --> 00:23:13.656
Sherry, it was with you

00:23:13.692 --> 00:23:18.595
That I laughed

00:23:18.630 --> 00:23:20.996
Sherry, far away

00:23:21.032 --> 00:23:23.432
Sherry, it was you

00:23:23.468 --> 00:23:28.098
That I held

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.438
I sung the memories

00:23:30.475 --> 00:23:32.966
Forever melodies

00:23:33.011 --> 00:23:35.241
I sung the memories

00:23:37.983 --> 00:23:40.315
I sung the memories

00:23:40.352 --> 00:23:42.843
Forever melodies

00:23:42.888 --> 00:23:45.083
I sung the memories

00:23:48.126 --> 00:23:50.356
Sherry, far away

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:52.897
Sherry, far away

00:23:52.931 --> 00:23:59.962
I know you can find
my melodies

